    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24181" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Intercatĭa</span></b> , ae,
		f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				city of</i> Hispania Tarraconensis, <i><span class="en">Liv.
				Epit. 48 <i>med.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Max. 3,
				2, 6</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Intercatĭensis</span></b> ,
				e, adj., <i>of</i> or
				<i>from Intercatia</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 37, 1,
				4, § 9</span></i>. — <i>Plur.
			absol.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Intercatienses</span></b> ,
				ium, m., <i>the
				inhabitants of Intercatia</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 3,
				4, § 26</span></i>.</div>
